Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:48:49 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 417/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0414: skip the
 refusal dismissal for a stale auto token, normalize the trigger, add tests

A PreCompact trigger=auto token can sit unused for hours, so a refused manual /compact armed a dismissal that posted a spurious failed. The pending token now carries its trigger and the refusal path skips auto tokens. The hook record keeps only auto and manual triggers. Tests cover auto then a transcript summary, a synchronous auto compaction, auto then manual, trigger parsing and the state round trip. Comments updated.
